From unicode.conf:

#"vodbridge"	3	00b7
#"hodbridge"	3	00b7
...
#"room"	7	00b7

They look the same because they're defined to have the same
character as a room square.  Try changing those lines to:

!"vodbridge"	3	0023
!"hodbridge"	3	0023

That will make it obvious.

The difference is that the drawbridges on the Valkyrie quest start
open while the castle drawbridge starts closed.

